cyber-trust-oscal
=================

This repository publishes OSCAL 1.1.2 conversion artifacts derived from the CSA Cybersecurity Certification: Cyber Trust Mark (v202504).

Source document
---------------

Title:     CSA Cybersecurity Certification: Cyber Trust Mark
Version:   v202504
Publisher: Cyber Security Agency of Singapore
Published: April 2025
URL:       https://www.csa.gov.sg/cyber-trust

Scope of the conversion: Annex B (Cybersecurity preparedness domains and descriptions), covering the Classical cybersecurity, Cloud security, OT security and AI security columns, in the folders classical-cybersecurity, cloud-security, ot-cybersecurity and ai-cybersecurity.

The source content remains © Cyber Security Agency of Singapore. The upstream PDF is the authoritative text; the OSCAL rendering in this repository is unofficial and is not published or endorsed by CSA.

The source PDF itself is NOT redistributed from this repository. The `rlinks` in each catalog JSON file point to the canonical URL above.

